    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Look at more\n",
        "\n",
        "- Write a function to check some images out.\n"
      ],
      "id": "10895da1"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "def see_im(n):\n",
        "\tplt.imshow(digits[\"images\"][n], cmap='Greys', interpolation='spline16')\n",
        "\tplt.axis('off') # Just looked up how to remove axes\n",
        "\tplt.title(digits[\"target\"][n])\n",
        "\tplt.show() # Like print, for images, or you can save"
      ],
      "id": "22dda744",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "- Wait how many do I have?"
      ],
      "id": "dac5d4f4"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "digits[\"target\"].shape"
      ],
      "id": "53fa0f7e",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## See More\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.columns}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"33%\"}\n"
      ],
      "id": "e89946e5"
    },
    {
